From 29f06975b3c2746bdef81e17a3f3f5ceca0df398 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel Sobral Teixeira <mest2011mest@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:34:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: sdm660: Enable the MAX98927 amplifier driver

Build the max98927 driver, which also handles the MAX98937, as a
module. The Redmi Note 7 (lavender) speaker needs it.

Signed-off-by: Miguel Sobral Teixeira <mest2011mest@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/sdm660_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/sdm660_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/sdm660_defconfig
index 3695b920a560ad..950f223f6b4806 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/sdm660_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/sdm660_defconfig
@@ -574,6 +574,7 @@ CONFIG_SND_SOC_QCOM=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_APQ8016_SBC=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_QDSP6_USB=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_SM8250=m
+CONFIG_SND_SOC_MAX98927=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_MSM8916_WCD_ANALOG=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_MSM8916_WCD_DIGITAL=m
 CONFIG_SND_SOC_TAS2557=m
